actus is coming after  phase six as well so based off of what  we know phase six will be kang and doom  then we'll have secret wars and a bunch  of different variants which is going to  be an epic battle but then after that  we'll get more focus on the fantastic  four the x-men the cosmic entities and  galactus will come and hopefully the  silver surfer his herald comes before  him and joins the fight i think this  would be the best saga that we've got so  far from the mcu granted we haven't  finished phase five and six yet and i do  believe they're going to be epic but i  think phase seven and beyond are going  to be even more epic but let me know  what you think about all of this in the  comments down below what do you think  we'll see in phase seven don't forget to  like the video and subscribe so you  don't miss out on any of the latest mcu  news for live updates you can follow me  on instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof

